  "title": "SoleMart — Best buying guide",
  "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"solemart-best-guide\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group solemart-best-guide\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-guide-intro\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-guide-intro\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Introduce the focus keyword and explain who this guide helps. Keep the introduction short and useful.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The quick answer:</strong> Name the best starting point for each main use case and explain the deciding difference.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-disclosure\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-disclosure\">Some links below lead to Amazon. We may earn a commission from qualifying purchases, at no extra cost to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-quick-picks\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-quick-picks\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-eyebrow\">YOUR SHORTLIST</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"quick-picks\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"quick-picks\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your shortlist, at a glance</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Start with what you do most. Select a model to jump to its strengths, trade-offs and buying link.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"hasFixedLayout\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Best for</th><th>Our pick</th><th>Start here if…</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Best for a specific use</td><td><a href=\"#product-1\">Product name 1</a></td><td>State the specific reader or activity this option suits.</td></tr><tr><td>Best for a specific use</td><td><a href=\"#product-2\">Product name 2</a></td><td>State the specific reader or activity this option suits.</td></tr><tr><td>Best for a specific use</td><td><a href=\"#product-3\">Product name 3</a></td><td>State the specific reader or activity this option suits.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-method\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-method\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-eyebrow\">BEHIND THE PICKS</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"how-we-chose\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"how-we-chose\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">How we chose</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Describe the sources you actually checked and how you selected the products. Link to supporting evidence and distinguish research from any testing you performed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-label\"><strong>01</strong> Best for a specific use</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"product-1\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"product-1\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Product name 1</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-layout\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-layout\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-visual\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-visual\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"sm-product-image\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full sm-product-image\"><img src=\"https://thesolemart.com/placeholder.svg\" alt=\"Placeholder for Product name 1 product photograph\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Product name 1</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-lede\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-lede\">Explain the main reason to consider this product in one or two sentences.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> State the specific reader or activity this option suits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why it makes the shortlist</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Explain the features that support the recommendation, include a relevant source link, and tell readers where the product has limitations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros-cons\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pros\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pros\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pros</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A specific, supported benefit.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Another useful benefit.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-cons\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consider</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A meaningful limitation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A reason to choose another option.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.amazon.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Buy on Amazon</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-cta-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-cta-note\">Search Amazon listings for this model. Check the exact version, size, seller and return terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-label\"><strong>02</strong> Best for a specific use</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"product-2\"} -->\n<h2 id=\"product-2\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Product name 2</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-layout\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-layout\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-visual\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-visual\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"sm-product-image\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full sm-product-image\"><img src=\"https://thesolemart.com/placeholder.svg\" alt=\"Placeholder for Product name 2 product photograph\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Product name 2</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"sm-pick-content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group sm-pick-content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"sm-pick-lede\"} -->\n<p class=\"sm-pick-lede\">Explain the main reason to consider this product in one or two sentences.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Best for:</strong> State the specific reader or activity this option suits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph